        "Title": "[AUoA#1] Stolen Glamour",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102062236078",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour destination is the Sanguine fashion show in Paris. Our client has heard a spreading rumor that lead designer Sebastian Sato was caught plagiarizing their unreleased designs. As one last grasp at fortune, he&#39;s selling every bit of stolen information at a private auction on the highest floor. Coincidentally, it seems some of our own data has been leaked to the ringleader, hence our involvement.\r\rYour primary task is to take out auctioneer Nicolas Frank. To satisfy our client, we must silence Sebastian Sato as well. However, Sebastian is a public figure. Ensure his death looks innocuous.",
